        <briefdescription>
<para>Resolves the shared singletons and caches copies of the server/database configuration. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Resolves the <ref refid="classStore" kindref="compound">Store</ref> singletons and snapshots the configuration used throughout startup.</para>
<para>Objects come from <ref refid="classStore_1a0607fb3b583c06ca910ed6c9881e790c" kindref="member">Store::getObject</ref>, so a later registration through <ref refid="classStore_1a2a4bfc0b18f2999216eda3067988cf57" kindref="member">Store::replaceObject</ref> will not replace the instances held here. The filter and middleware instances are constructed here and owned by the <ref refid="classServer" kindref="compound">Server</ref> for its entire lifetime.</para>
<para>Objects fetched here are shared_ptrs, so they remain valid for the lifetime of the <ref refid="classServer" kindref="compound">Server</ref>. The two <ref refid="classConfigurator" kindref="compound">Configurator</ref> structs are copied by value; configuration changes made after construction are not observed. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
