        <detaileddescription>
<para>Prints the effective configuration and the startup logo.</para>
<para>The configuration dump is produced by <ref refid="classConfigurator_1aa1007b1c4fab1119faf6c4398d8e1f71" kindref="member">Configurator::printValues()</ref> and is followed by version, port, thread count, database connection count, and documentation URL. stdout is explicitly flushed so the banner is visible before the Drogon loggers take over the console.</para>
<para>Writes to stdout and explicitly flushes it so the banner appears before framework logging begins. The displayed version comes from the build-time VALHALLA_GIT_TAG, not from the <ref refid="classConfigurator" kindref="compound">Configurator</ref> snapshot. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
